    </p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;justify-content:center">
        <a class="btn btn--red" href="/"><span>Về trang chủ</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/cua-hang"><span>Xem cửa hàng</span></a>
